WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.410
"Remember, Snow White," Dar said.

2
00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:15.494
"Don't let anyone in!"

3
00:00:15.495 --> 00:00:27.855
"I won't," Snow White said.

4
00:00:27.856 --> 00:00:32.946
Snow White swept.

5
00:00:32.947 --> 00:00:40.416
Then she sat down with a book.

6
00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:41.645
Knock, knock!

7
00:00:41.646 --> 00:00:43.927
Snow White jumped up.

8
00:00:43.928 --> 00:00:47.058
"Who is it?" Snow White asked.

9
00:00:47.059 --> 00:00:51.473
"Just an old woman," the person said.

10
00:00:51.474 --> 00:00:54.060
Snow White peeked outside.

11
00:00:54.061 --> 00:00:58.098
She saw a woman with a long nose.

12
00:00:58.099 --> 00:01:01.058
"Hmm," Snow White thought.

13
00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:05.098
"She's not the woman from yesterday."

14
00:01:05.099 --> 00:01:08.573
"Please buy a comb," the woman said.

15
00:01:08.574 --> 00:01:12.270
"I need money for food."

16
00:01:12.271 --> 00:01:21.958
"Oh, you're hungry?" Snow White felt sad.

17
00:01:21.959 --> 00:01:28.209
"Come in," she said.

18
00:01:28.210 --> 00:01:32.211
The woman handed a comb to Snow White.

19
00:01:32.212 --> 00:01:38.612
"It's lovely!" Snow White said.

20
00:01:38.613 --> 00:01:44.087
Snow White ran the comb through her hair.

21
00:01:44.088 --> 00:01:50.055
"Ahh!" She fell to the floor.

22
00:01:50.056 --> 00:01:53.525
The woman laughed.

23
00:01:53.526 --> 00:02:00.239
"Good-bye, Snow White!"

24
00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:07.953
The dwarfs arrived home.

25
00:02:07.954 --> 00:02:11.599
Snow White lay on the floor very still.

26
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.563
"Oh no!" Dar cried.

27
00:02:14.564 --> 00:02:17.629
The dwarfs tried to wake her up.

28
00:02:17.630 --> 00:02:20.590
"Is she dead?" Mar asked.

29
00:02:20.591 --> 00:02:24.255
Star wiped a tear from his eye.

30
00:02:24.256 --> 00:02:26.993
"What's this?" Par asked.

31
00:02:26.994 --> 00:02:32.563
He pulled a comb from Snow White's hair.

32
00:02:32.564 --> 00:02:37.831
The princess woke up!

33
00:02:37.832 --> 00:02:44.212
"That comb must be poisoned," Dar said.

34
00:02:44.213 --> 00:02:48.413
Zar made a fist. "The queen did this."

35
00:02:48.414 --> 00:02:55.204
Yar made a fist. "She's the worst!"

36
00:02:55.205 --> 00:02:58.722
At the castle a servant passed the queen's room.

37
00:02:58.723 --> 00:03:11.145
From inside he heard a terrible shout.

